{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for the EOL state of every package the FreeUnit Homebrew tap depends on. Read it before bumping any dependency, so a disable date never breaks CI unnoticed.",
  "_policy_packages": "Homebrew disables a versioned formula once the unversioned formula covers it. A disabled formula cannot be installed at all, so the tap build fails with 'has been disabled because it is a versioned formula'. Move the dependency before the disable date.",
  "_policy_tap": "The tap pins its own releases. A formula in this tap is updated when the upstream release lands, so the tap version trails the upstream branch by design.",
  "_date_format": "eol and supported_until use YYYY-MM-DD. days_left is the number of days from the check date to the date; a negative value means the deadline has passed.",
  "_source_homebrew": "https://formulae.brew.sh/api/formula/<name>.json",
  "_source_tap": "https://github.com/freeunitorg/homebrew-unit",
