  "_comment_tap_formulae": "The tap ships one formula per supported PHP series: php-embed, php-embed@8.4, php-embed@8.3, and one unit-php module per series. Each formula pins the homebrew-core php formula of the same series. eol/check.py verifies that every pin matches the PHP version that the formula builds."
